      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">"The Shadout Mapes," Jessica said, remembering the encounter at the stairs.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Shadout Mapes" target="legend" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"It was said that the Shadout Mapes gave this report on you," Stilgar said.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="my Lord" target="Jessica" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOVES</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">Ah-h-h-h, my Jessica, would that we were somewhere else, anywhere away from this terrible place -alone, the two of us, without a care.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="the Emperor" target="the planetologist" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">this planetologist the Emperor and the Landsraad installed as Judge of the Change</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="the Landsraad" target="the planetologist" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">this planetologist the Emperor and the Landsraad installed as Judge of the Change</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Albe" target="painting of Leto's father" id="0">
      <data key="d12">CREATED</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">It had been done by the famed artist, Albe, during the Old Duke's middle years.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Mapes" target="legend" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">Mapes nodded. "Just as the legend says."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Mapes" target="violence" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">you have done violence and will yet do more violence</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Mapes" target="weapon" id="0">
      <data key="d12">OWNS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">I know you came prepared for violence with a weapon in your bodice</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Mapes" target="weapon" id="1">
      <data key="d12">GIFTED</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The weapon was sent as a gift to you should you prove to be the One</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Mapes" target="Jessica" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">this Fremen has taken service with me</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Mapes" target="Jessica" id="1">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Behind her, Mapes paused in clearing the wrappings from the bull's head, looked at the retreating back. "She's the One all right," she muttered.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Mapes" target="EVENT" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Mapes dropped the sheathed knife into Jessica's hand, tore open the brown bodice, wailing: "Take the water of my life!"</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Mapes" target="Arrakis" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
