    <edge source="Old Duke" target="Duke's father" id="0">
      <data key="d12">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">That's the blood of our Duke's father. Those horns were sprayed with a transparent fixative within hours after this beast killed the Old Duke.</data>
    </edge>
