    </edge>
    <edge source="Arrakeen landing field" target="Arrakis" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Over the exit of the Arrakeen landing field, crudely carved as though with a poor instrument, there was an inscription that Muad'Dib was to repeat many times. He saw it that first night on Arrakis</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Idaho" target="cave complex" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ESTIMATES</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Idaho estimates the cave complex he visited consisted of some ten thousand people, all told.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Idaho" target="sietch" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Idaho had free access to every part of the sietch.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Idaho" target="Fremen" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Idaho did say one thing: he said you couldn't mistake the Fremen attitude toward shields.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Idaho" target="attack" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">In the attack, however, we found the Harkonnens had waylaid the Fremen courier</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Idaho" target="knife" id="0">
      <data key="d12">FOUND</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">I surprised him in the attempt to throw something away." Idaho glanced down at Leto. "A knife, m'Lord, a knife the like of which you've never seen.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Idaho" target="Stilgar" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"This is Stilgar, chief of the sietch I visited, leader of those who warned us of the false band," Idaho said.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Idaho" target="Stilgar" id="1">
      <data key="d12">FRIENDS_WITH</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">"I remind you this is the blade of one who befriended you."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Idaho" target="Duke" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Use some of Idaho's men</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Idaho" target="Leto" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Idaho would be the ideal choice for the job.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Idaho" target="EVENT" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Killed more'n three hunner' men f'r the Duke</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Idaho" target="Jessica" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Idaho jerked himself upright, scowling down at her.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Idaho" target="get through to Kynes" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"If Idaho doesn't get through to Kynes, we'll be--"</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Idaho" target="Paul" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Idaho skidded to a stop in front of Paul</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Idaho" target="Paul" id="1">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">But now Idaho is dead.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Idaho" target="The Baron" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The man Idaho led us to them, then?" the Baron asked.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Idaho" target="Kynes" id="0">
      <data key="d12">FRIENDS_WITH</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">Idaho joined this Kynes under mysterious circumstances</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Idaho" target="vision" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Idaho was with us in the vision, he remembered.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Liet" target="sietch communities" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">All seem to give their allegiance to someone called Liet.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Liet" target="two masters" id="0">
      <data key="d12">SERVES</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Liet serves two masters.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Liet" target="advance bases" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"The answer to that question," Hawat said, "is invariably: 'Liet knows.' "</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Liet" target="EVENT" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">One of them whispered: "Liet."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Liet" target="Fremen" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">But only my brother, Liet, speaks for all Fremen.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Liet" target="Stilgar" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"It's Liet's command," Stilgar said.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="smuggler caravan" target="sietch" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">A smuggler caravan left this sietch while Idaho was there, carrying a heavy load of spice.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Judge of the Change" target="Imperial inventory" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">A full complement, as it says in the Imperial inventory audited by the Judge of the Change, my Lord," Hawat said.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="carryall" target="Hawat" id="0">
      <data key="d12">CREATED</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"This is a carryall," Hawat said.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="carryall" target="spice harvesting" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">It's essentially a large 'thopter, whose sole function is to deliver a factory to spice-rich sands, then to rescue the factory when a sandworm appears.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Harkonnen mercenaries" target="Fremen" id="0">
      <data key="d12">DISGUISED_AS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">We've taken a force of Harkonnen mercenaries disguised as Fremen.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Stilgar" target="sietch" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"This is Stilgar, chief of the sietch I visited, leader of those who warned us of the false band," Idaho said.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Stilgar" target="Duncan Idaho" id="0">
      <data key="d12">FRIENDS_WITH</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">You took away with you my father's man, Duncan Idaho--an exchange of friends.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Stilgar" target="name" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"You heard this Stilgar use the name."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Stilgar" target="Paul" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"I know you, Stilgar," Paul said.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Stilgar" target="tribe" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">"My duty is the strength of the tribe," Stilgar said.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Stilgar" target="Jessica" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Stilgar glanced at Jessica.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Stilgar" target="Istislah" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">It is the rule, Istislah, in the general interest.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Stilgar" target="his people" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">As leader of my people, I've put them in bond to my word.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Stilgar" target="weirding way" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">Teach us this weirding way and you have sanctuary with us as long as you wish.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Stilgar" target="Fremen" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">As leader of my people, I've put them in bond to my word.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Stilgar" target="Chani" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"I said leave him be, Chani! You spawn of a lizard!"</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Stilgar" target="the troop" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">Stilgar stood at one side motioning them</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Stilgar" target="free traders" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">We've been out overlong arranging to deliver our spice quota to the free traders</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Stilgar" target="troop" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Stilgar nodded, tugging at his beard</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Stilgar" target="passage" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Stilgar had said.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Turok" target="passage" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Turok was the name of our dead friend.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Piter de Vries" target="Leto" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">"Piter de Vries," the Duke said.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Piter de Vries" target="Mentat-Assassin" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Piter de Vries, the Mentat-Assassin.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Piter de Vries" target="Arrakis" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">blue-ink eyes that suggested he was a native of Arrakis</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="bases" target="His Majesty's fief" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"Those bases are still legally His Majesty's fief."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Pardee" target="Harkonnen underground" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">We've good reason to believe Pardee was top man in the Harkonnen underground here.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Atreides guard" target="Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">An Atreides guard stood beside it</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Fremen guard" target="Dr. Kynes" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">signaled for his Fremen guard to fall back</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="tall man" target="Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">He wore a jubba cloak with Atreides crest at the breast</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="worms" target="spice sands" id="0">
      <data key="d12">DEFENDS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">They defend spice sands.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="worms" target="spice" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Wherever there is spice, there are worms.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="worms" target="shields" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Activate a shield within the worm zone and you seal your fate. Worms ignore territory lines, come from far around to attack a shield.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Delta Ajax niner" target="Wormsign warning" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Glancing at the grid chart on rollers over their heads, he spoke into the microphone: "Calling crawler at Delta Ajax niner. Wormsign warning. Crawler at Delta Ajax niner. Wormsign warning. Acknowledge, please."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="worm" target="sand" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The worm is now beneath the crawler," Kynes said.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="worm" target="hissing approach" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">saw the mound of the coursing worm.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="guests" target="dinner" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">for guests as they entered to dip their hands ceremoniously into a basin</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="beggars" target="dinner" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">beggars gathered outside to get the water squeezings from the towels</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="stillsuit manufacturer" target="Carthag" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">a stillsuit manufacturer down from Carthag</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="stillsuit manufacturer" target="dinner" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The stillsuit manufacturer complimented Jessica on her chef and wine.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="water-shipper" target="polar-cap factory" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">a water-shipper whose summer mansion was near his polar-cap factory</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="escort service" target="smuggling, spying, and blackmail operations" id="0">
      <data key="d12">COVER_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">an escort service for off-planet visitors reputedly operated as cover for various smuggling, spying, and blackmail operations</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lingar Bewt" target="Harkonnens" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">The Harkonnens used him but never fully controlled him.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lingar Bewt" target="water facilities" id="0">
      <data key="d12">OWNS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">Water was, indeed, power here. If water facilities were mined, for instance, ready to be destroyed at a signal . . . The man looked capable of such a thing.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Lingar Bewt" target="water magnate" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">She glanced at Lingar Bewt. The water magnate was scowling, concentrating on his dinner.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bewt" target="water facilities" id="0">
      <data key="d12">OWNS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The man looked capable of such a thing. Destruction of water facilities might well destroy Arrakis. That could well have been the club this Bewt held over the Harkonnens.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bewt" target="Arrakis" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"Nothing about Arrakis is normal!"</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Bewt" target="water" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"Master Bewt is an expert on water," Kynes said.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Guild Bank representative" target="conversation" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">The Guild Bank representative had fallen into conversation with the watershipper</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Guild Bank representative" target="dinner" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The Guild Bank representative looked across at Kynes.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Guild Bank representative" target="Guild Bank" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">that Guild Bank representative</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Guild Bank representative" target="House Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">the man was a Harkonnen agent</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Esmar Tuek" target="smugglers" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The smuggler's called Tuek, Esmar Tuek. He's a power among his kind.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Guild Bank" target="EVENT" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Jessica lowered her gaze, glanced at the people seated nearest her--there was the round-faced water-shipper and his woman, the pale and austere Guild Bank representative (he seemed a whistle-faced scarecrow with his eyes fixed on Leto), the rugged and scar-faced Tuck, his blue-within-blue eyes downcast.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Guild Bank" target="Guild" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">that Guild Bank representative</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Soo-Soo" target="Water Peddlers Union" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">they call me Soo-Soo because I'm financial adviser to the Water Peddlers Union</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Tuek" target="smuggler" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">It was the smuggler, Tuek</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Tuek" target="smuggler" id="1">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">It was the smuggler, Tuek, head thrown back laughing with complete abandon.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Tuek" target="service passage" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">saw that it was a human figure, a  man face down on the stone. Leto turned him over with a foot, knife poised, bent  close in the dim light to see the face. It was the smuggler, Tuek, a wet stain  down his chest.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Tuek" target="Arrakis" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"Arrakis is our enemy."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Tuek" target="smugglers" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">the smuggler reminded him of Duke Leto: a leader of men</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Tuek" target="ORGANIZATION" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">I've some off-shipments of spice to see to first.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="banker" target="EVENT" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The banker put down his fork, spoke in an angry voice</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="banker" target="Jessica" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The banker turned a sickly grin toward Jessica, said: "My Lady, I fear I've overindulged in your wines.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Harkonnen agent" target="smugglers' base" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">A Harkonnen agent in the crew overpowered the others and flew the machine to a smugglers' base, hoping to sell it there.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Harkonnen agent" target="Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">A Harkonnen agent in the crew overpowered the others and flew the machine to a smugglers' base, hoping to sell it there. Both man and machine were turned over to our forces.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Jamis" target="Songs of Muad'Dib" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Dirge for Jamis on the Funeral Plain, from "Songs of Muad'Dib" by the Princess Irulan</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Jamis" target="ceremony" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Only the man called Jamis seemed to stand aloof from the ceremony</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Jamis" target="Stilgar" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"You'll not buy us off with water," Jamis growled. "Nor will you anger me against yourself, Stilgar."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Jamis" target="EVENT" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Jamis stepped into the ring, slipped out of his robe and tossed it to someone in the crowd.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Jamis" target="Paul" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">Jamis could do anything . . . any unpredictable thing</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Jamis" target="passage" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">They're recovering Jamis' water</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Reverend Mother Gaius Helen" target="Truthsayer" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">He fears the questioning of a Truthsayer, Jessica thought. Who? Ah-h-h, the Reverend Mother Gaius Helen, of course!</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Harkonnen troopers" target="Baron" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Two Harkonnen troopers entered.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Harkonnen troopers" target="Fremen" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The Harkonnen troopers had left him here without water or stillsuit, thinking a worm would get him if the desert didn't.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Harkonnen troopers" target="Kynes" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The Harkonnen troopers had left him here without water or stillsuit, thinking a worm would get him if the desert didn't.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Scarface" target="Piter" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Scarface looked at Piter.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Scarface" target="pilot" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">He turned to look at the pilot.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Kinet" target="Czigo" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">He looked at Czigo.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Arkie" target="service of Lisan al-Gaib" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Paradise were sure for a man who died in the service of Lisan al-Gaib</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Baron" target="Nefud" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The Baron stared at Nefud</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Baron" target="Nefud" id="1">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Do you think I'll praise you for such stupidity, give you another promotion?</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Baron" target="Atreides" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">We know how we overwhelmed the Atreides.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Baron" target="Hawat" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">If they suspect anything at all it's that I wish to destroy the Mentat.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Baron" target="Hawat" id="1">
      <data key="d12">LOVES</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">Hawat by my side! the Baron thought.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Baron" target="Sardaukar" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.8</data>
      <data key="d14">We will hide him from the Sardaukar.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Baron" target="the woman and the boy" id="0">
      <data key="d12">ENEMY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.7</data>
      <data key="d14">The woman and the boy were dead.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Nefud" target="The Baron" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Nefud bowed, turned, and hurried away.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Rabban" target="The Baron" id="0">
      <data key="d12">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">his older nephew, Rabban.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Rabban" target="Baron" id="0">
      <data key="d12">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Rabban stared at his uncle, suddenly frightened by the sound of those words.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Rabban" target="Baron" id="1">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Rabban said. "Could I--" "I'm removing them," the Baron said.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Rabban" target="Baron" id="2">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"What you do understand is how to carry out my orders."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Muad'Dib: Conversations" target="Princess Irulan" id="0">
      <data key="d12">CREATED</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">-from "Muad'Dib: Conversations" by the Princess Irulan</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Staban Tuek" target="Esmar Tuek" id="0">
      <data key="d12">FAMILY_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"I am Staban Tuek, son of Esmar Tuek," the smuggler said.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Count Rabban" target="Lankiveil" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LOCATED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">The Count Rabban of Lankiveil?</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Drisq" target="Tuek" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Consult my quartermaster," Tuek said. "Drisq is his name.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="thumper" target="drumming from the cliff" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"The thumper," Paul hissed.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Liet-Kynes" target="His Imperial Majesty" id="0">
      <data key="d12">WORKS_FOR</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"I am His Imperial Majesty's Planetologist,"</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Liet-Kynes" target="Arrakis" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MEMBER_OF</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">"planetary ecologist for Arrakis."</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Chani" target="ceremony" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Chani whispered</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Chani" target="Paul" id="0">
      <data key="d12">KNOWS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">the elfin-faced Chani whispering in his ear as she nodded toward Jamis</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Chani" target="passage" id="0">
      <data key="d12">MENTIONED_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">trailed by the elfin-faced Chani.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Chani" target="weighing of the water" id="0">
      <data key="d12">PARTICIPATES_IN</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">Chani showed me . . . because I'm supposed to see it and give my . . . permission for the weighing of the water.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sayyadina" target="special place of honor" id="0">
      <data key="d12">LEADS</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">the Sayyadina, when they are not the formal leaders, hold a special place of honor.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Sayyadina" target="strength of God" id="0">
      <data key="d12">TEACHES</data>
      <data key="d13">0.9</data>
      <data key="d14">They teach. They maintain the strength of God here.</data>
    </edge>
